===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[hindmost]] part of anything (a person, animal, or object), the [[rear end]]; the [[butt]], [[buttock]]s; [[hindquarter]]s, [[rump]].
# {{lb|en|figurative}} The last part of a period of time, event, or situation; the concluding or final part.
#: {{ux|en|At the '''tail end''' of summer.}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''tail end''' of a lecture.}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''tail end''' of a conversation.}}
